Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got real ships to work\Non, not your crappy toys.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.19,0:02:53.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,680)\fad(450,0)\blur0.5\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\c&H120903&\3c&H120903&\1a&HFF&\bord2.7\t(405,450,\1a&H00&)}Cutty Flam (Franky)\N12 Years Old
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.19,0:02:53.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,680)\fad(450,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\4a&HFF&}Cutty Flam (Franky)\N12 Years Old
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't yell at me when you don't have\Na clue what you're talking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ice for brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't some crappy toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:02:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my super battleship\Nthat battled Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.72,0:03:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, you need to leave\Nit alone before someone gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Scrap Heave Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.14,0:03:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to build a battleship\Nawesome enough to take down a Sea King.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bull, what you're going to\Ndo is get yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Yeah, quick. Nuh-uh. Real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.58,0:03:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to be a man, show some gusto.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.36,0:03:46.75,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,658)\fad(600,0)\blur0.5\bord2.7\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\c&H211E20&\3c&H211E20&\1a&HFF&\t(555,600,\1a&H00&)}President Tom (Longhorn Cowfish Fishman)\NTom's Workers Shipbuilding
Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.36,0:03:46.75,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,658)\fad(600,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\c&HFFFEFF&\4a&HFF&\t(555,600,\1a&H00&)}President Tom (Longhorn Cowfish Fishman)\NTom's Workers Shipbuilding
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's the old launching ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more ship sailing with gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha! Right, buddy?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.79,0:03:48.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,679)\fad(420,0)\blur0.5\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\c&H121213&\1a&HFF&\bord2.7\t(375,420,\1a&H00&)\3c&H121213&}Yokozuna (Sumo Frog)\NTom's Pet
Dialogue: 2,0:03:46.79,0:03:48.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,679)\fad(420,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\4a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&}Yokozuna (Sumo Frog)\NTom's Pet
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giddle, giddle, giddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's about enough work for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say we head on home?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giddle, giddle.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.55,0:03:59.68,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,674)\fad(435,480)\blur0.5\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\c&H121213&\3c&H121213&\1a&HFF&\bord2.7\t(390,435,\1a&H00&)\t(4650,4695,\1a&HFF&)}Opposite the Warehouse Under the Bridge\NWater Seven
Dialogue: 2,0:03:54.55,0:03:59.68,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,674)\fad(435,480)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\4a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&}Opposite the Warehouse Under the Bridge\NWater Seven
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm hungry. Giddle, giddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see what's for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giddle, giddle.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.72,0:04:03.81,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,653)\fad(440,0)\blur0.5\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\c&H121213&\3c&H121213&\1a&HFF&\bord2.7\t(395,440,\1a&H00&)}Scrap Island\N(Tom's Workers Dockyard)
Dialogue: 2,0:03:59.72,0:04:03.81,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,653)\fad(440,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\4a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&}Scrap Island\N(Tom's Workers Dockyard)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.82,0:04:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So today's Battle Franky model\Nwas number, what are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was really beautiful. No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your dumb weapon that he let\Nyou build for some reason
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fell apart after you almost\Nkilled both of us with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody asked you, you\Nstupid ice for brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice for brains?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're flunky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough\Nfighting, boys. Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.14,0:04:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He started it, not me.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.38,0:04:44.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,687)\fad(440,440)\blur0.5\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\c&H121213&\3c&H121213&\1a&HFF&\bord2.7\t(395,440,\1a&H00&)\t(5740,5785,\1a&HFF&)}Kokoro, a Beautiful Secretary\NTom's Workers
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.38,0:04:44.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,687)\fad(440,440)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\4a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&}Kokoro, a Beautiful Secretary\NTom's Workers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.70,0:04:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't encourage those two, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.77,0:04:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'll keep misbehaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of misbehaving,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.90,0:04:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that another ship carrying\Nlumber was attacked by pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, ever since the king\Nof the pirates was executed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this place has just gone\Nrotten with those Newgate bums.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:04:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're taking over the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people's spirits are really low.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because of all the\Nflooding from Aqualaguna,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can only get lumber and iron if\Nwe ship them in from other islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with all the storms and pirates\Neverywhere, it's near impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.34,0:05:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shipyards are starting to\Nget so desperate for customers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they are literally fighting\Neach other for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many have closed down already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water 7 is on a course to sink into the\Nocean and fade from the world's memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to think, this city made\Nits name, making unforgettable,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unsinkable ships such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you built a big, super awesome\Npirate ship once now, didn't you, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you teach me how to draw\Nout blueprints for one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so funny, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky, there's no such thing\Nas blueprints for a pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the flag, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skull and bones means pirate ship,\Nand a Skull flag means that it's navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you build, just remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Build it with pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a whole lot of manly gusto!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure are working late tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This here is hope for our island
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least that's what I'm\Nhoping that it'll turn into someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, to bed with ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The judicial ship is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.06,0:06:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mobile court.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.46,0:06:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder who they're here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him go, you big stupid jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Justice was brought to Gold Roger, the\Nking of the pirates, by way of execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His ship, the Oro Jackson,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was built by none other than Tom,\Nwho stands before this court today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As penalty for aiding and\Nabetting that vicious criminal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tom will be taken to Enies\NLobby where he will be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The verdict was read. Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going to execute Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say it's because he built a\Nship for the king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing brought a whole\Nlot of grief into the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, building ships is not a crime,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and one may sell them to almost\Nanyone who wishes to buy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we must make an exception\Nfor the king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the charge of providing\Nmeaningful assistance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the man who terrorized\Nthe entire world,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we hereby sentence Tom to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, time to go. Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a new design for a\Ncompletely new kind of paddle steamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A train that will run on the\Nsurface of the ocean with gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up. Get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This once great island has lost its gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.48,0:08:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our trade is not what it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People have lost hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water 7 is slowly sinking away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day, our hard-working\Ncitizens are filled with worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.72,0:08:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can lift their spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By building our good people a Sea Train!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit flapping your gums\Nand move your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:08:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, let him stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:08:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea Train.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a ship, but one that\Npuffs out steam and runs on a track.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll go between the islands, carrying\Npeople and all kinds of goods,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even other ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most importantly, it won't be\Naffected by conditions at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.84,0:09:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A railway on the water will be ripped\Nto pieces once Aqualaguna comes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if it doesn't, what are you going\Nto do about all the sea kings out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.34,0:09:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have to be a\Ncompletely fixed track.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.83,0:09:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be submerged under the water a bit,\Nso it won't be bombarded by the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll sway, just like a rope in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sea Train will just use the tracks\Nas a guide to get from place to place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm also considering installing\Na mechanism that emits a loud,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dissonant sound underwater to discourage\Nfish from getting anywhere near the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should work on sea kings as\Nwell, so they won't pose a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is all that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we connect St.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poplar, Pucci,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanfaldo, and this island,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:10:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can create a booming economy\Nthat will help out all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be finished with\Nthe blueprints very soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it will take a master\Nshipwright to build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, could the Sea Train\Nrun to Enies Lobby as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without a doubt, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the plans are in the can\Nand the railway is in the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people can go with gusto from\Nisland to island for work or play.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once again, Water 7 will\Nbe a city filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long will it take?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you agree to develop this Sea Train,\NI will give you the time to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider these next\Nten years as probation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save Water 7, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.88,0:10:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you think this is so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.24,0:10:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried sick over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess if this\Nplan of yours works out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're willing to forgive and\Nforget the whole Gold Roger affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I just got to tell you\Nhow amazed I am with you, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's unbelievable to think you could\Njust come up with that on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's brilliant when you told...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yokozuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you the front crawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're all celebrating\Nhere, and you want to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.15,0:11:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to Tom was so unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He built the only ship that was\Nable to sail the whole Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something no one else\Nin the world could do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.54,0:11:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those jerks want to\Nput him to death over it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't realize how hard that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.16,0:11:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They couldn't even string together a\Nraft if their lives depended on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that the whole reason our\Noffice is under this bridge is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because those stupid people kicked\Nyou out of town over that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the greatest\Nshipbuilder the world has
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever known and they\Ntreat you like garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you laughing at,\Nyou big yellow weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.49,0:11:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop attacking him, you stupid kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does he have to laugh at everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:11:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're doing it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stroke harder and push that water back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no! Do it harder! Don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Frankie's got a lot of nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd kick him\Nout for what he just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I know the boy can be a handful,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's a fellow shipbuilder\Nat his young age He's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.08,0:12:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,almost on par with the best\Ncraftsman on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does build battleships.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His problem is he's too honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.70,0:12:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two years ago, I met that\Nkid on Scrap Heap Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd gone there to collect\Njunk to make a cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was firing it with Gusto
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old guy! Hey! Help me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My good-for-nothing parents ditched me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently his folks couldn't\Nhandle his rambunctious behavior,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.98,0:12:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they threw him off their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a couple of\Nheartless pirates to me, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.18,0:12:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.58,0:12:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is one tough kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's had a rough go at it, but\Nhe's still got a good heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive that both\Nof you boys are going to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grow up to be world-class\Nshipwrights someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to be rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he's allergic\Nto sanity or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.45,0:13:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to finish those blueprints and\Nthen we'll build ourselves a Sea Train.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet he won't help at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can do whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head of the fourth largest shipyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a tragic story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They ran out of materials, so he took\Na ship out to sea to get some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lost 50 men on the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had to close down his shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will this be how it ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this how Water 7 finally dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.04,0:15:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you guys hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big news from Scrap Heap Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.52,0:15:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Tom's workers actually\Nfinish the Sea Train?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.69,0:15:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.61,0:15:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this crazy thing really gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I trust\Nsomething built by a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.87,0:15:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what the heck, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They gonna tell us how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All aboard, ladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:15:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, the paddles have\Ngrabbed at the railway!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that is the coolest thing ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,12 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,departing from an isolated\Ncity in decline and full of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,passengers who've almost given\Nup hope for a brighter future,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.56,0:16:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,train Puffing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tom embarked on its maiden
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting, many ships were born in this\Ncobwebbed room and now look at it filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they built ships here\Ntom iceberg and cutty
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:17:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flam this place must hold\Ncountless memories of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.28,0:17:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,days when you still shared\Na life with those two
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now you call it your\Ntop secret base that's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heartbreakingly adorable\Ndamn you just get the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hell out of here already\Nwe won't leave till we
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get what we're after make\Nthis easy on yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there ain't no blueprints\Nin here oh no you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.74,0:17:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say just keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,together you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bastard take
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your time but be aware that we know many
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.30,0:17:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things about your past things that you\Ndon't want getting out for example we know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what happened eight years ago And that you\Nare guilty of committing a very serious
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:18:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crime back then just\Nlike your dear old Tom
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shut up. Tom was\Nnever a damn criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.28,0:18:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what the\Nhell you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You freak
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.14,0:18:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.80,0:18:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're both criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.56,0:18:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as such, you should be made to\Nfeel the consequences of your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky, whatever happens, don't\Ninterfere with what I'm about to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.82,0:18:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You talk like you know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.98,0:18:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know Tom and you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.98,0:18:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know anything about Water 7.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.98,0:18:51.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,781)\fad(522,0)\blur0.8\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\c&H121213&\3c&H121213&\1a&HFF&\bord3\t(477,522,\1a&H00&)}Water Seven, 8 Years Ago
Dialogue: 2,0:18:47.98,0:18:51.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,781)\fad(522,0)\blur0.8\bord0\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\4a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&}Water Seven, 8 Years Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:19:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the judicial ship\Nwill be here in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally putting Tom on trial are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it ends well for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.34,0:19:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fulfilled his promise, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get\Nthat lumber in the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.86,0:19:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how'd the deal work out with St.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poplar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.85,0:19:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're taking advantage of us since\Nwe don't have much to trade with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like iron from San Faldo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll all be in the red if\Nthis kind of crap keeps up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going to let this keep\Nhappening now, are we, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.31,0:19:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.56,0:19:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people do seem to be happy\Nabout being able to cross the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they say the trade situation\Nisn't as good as they'd hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this town needs\Nmore than a Sea Train.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.16,0:19:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But their spirits are up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.68,0:19:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, that's a major step.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.66,0:19:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So give the rest some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:19:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've done our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.59,0:20:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your head held high\Nand walk with gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.34,0:20:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I correct in assuming\NI'm speaking with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.08,0:20:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tom, the shipbuilding engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.70,0:20:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a difficult man to pin down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have some matter of\Ngreat importance I wish to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, this man and I are talking. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, before I was so rudely?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.34,0:20:40.68,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,661)\fad(435,0)\blur0.5\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\c&H121213&\3c&H121213&\1a&HFF&\bord2.7\t(390,435,\1a&H00&)}Director-General Spandam\NCipher Pol Number 5
Dialogue: 2,0:20:34.34,0:20:40.68,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,661)\fad(435,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\4a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&}Director-General Spandam\NCipher Pol Number 5
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.22,0:20:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my name is Agent Spandam\Nfrom Cipher Pole number five!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.84,0:20:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you got in the way\Nof my victory cannon salute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tough luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.03,0:20:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's super!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:20:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Battle Franky 35 comes home with booty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.44,0:21:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this not the biggest sea\Nking you ever laid your eyes on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.34,0:21:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe him,\Nstill acting like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think\Nyou're doing, ice for brains?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you ever grow up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since you were a kid, all you want\Nto do is build these stupid battleships.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.58,0:21:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This better be the last one, or I'm going\Nto start tearing them all apart myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.94,0:21:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want a vet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lay a finger on my ship, and\Nyou'll draw back a stump, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Well, listen Franky,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.22,0:21:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you were able to kill a sea king\Nwith this floating piece of junk,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that means it's a dangerous weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.22,0:21:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you've got all those other battleships\Nof yours just strewn around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.54,0:21:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.45,0:21:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's not like I'm attacking\Npeople with them, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying you'd do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.54,0:21:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're making it easier for\Nanyone else who'd want to, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:21:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.85,0:22:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back me up here, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flunky's weapons are going to\Nbe the end of our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flunky! That's rich! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.60,0:22:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no laughing matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.36,0:22:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I demand a sincere apology and that you\Nlisten to what I've come here to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.28,0:22:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Government guy, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, is this about the trial? Trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.94,0:22:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the devil are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.82,0:22:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this concerns an\Naltogether different matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.82,0:22:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Tom come back with you boys\Nno I think he's with a visitor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.66,0:22:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some man from the government\Nit wasn't about the tribe spawn
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.32,0:22:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spawn something Spawn something\Ndumb maybe how strange and he's
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.74,0:22:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not from the judicial ship. The\Ngovernment is so disorganized.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.80,0:22:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid not. I've got no blueprints\Nfor something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.56,0:22:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's nonsense do you take\Nme for some kind of weak
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.38,0:22:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-minded simpleton i researched\Nthe history of Water 7 for
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.44,0:23:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,countless hours and i am absolutely\Ncertain this document can
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.94,0:23:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only be in your possession you're\Nsaying that you actually have
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.46,0:23:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the authority to investigate\Nme that's right i do and what's
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.46,0:23:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more i learned all about your\Ndealings with gold roger in the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.68,0:23:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,course of my investigation so\Nunless you want me to share
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that information with my colleagues\Nyou're going to cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.98,0:23:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.12,0:23:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government already knows about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.73,0:23:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's such a poppycock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's true, why are you here\Nand not rotting away somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a jail cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your investigative powers\Nand find out for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.36,0:23:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't treat a\Ngovernment agent like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open this door immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.68,0:23:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.60,0:23:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.02,0:23:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.14,0:23:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did exactly what he\Ntold the judge he'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.14,0:23:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they should be dropping the\Ncharges at the trial that's coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.76,0:23:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man saved this island, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.60,0:24:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes my blood boil to think that damn\Ncriminal is being treated like a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.52,0:24:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.84,0:24:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're certain that such a\Nthing truly exists? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.04,0:24:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the pirates are scouring\Nthe globe for it as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.18,0:24:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why it's imperative\Nwe locate it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.84,0:24:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it were to fall into the wrong hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.92,0:24:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the resulting destruction\Nwould be inconceivable.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:20.11,0:24:24.19,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,722)\fad(435,435)\blur0.6\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\c&H121213&\3c&H121213&\1a&HFF&\bord2.7\t(390,435,\1a&H00&)\t(3645,3690,\1a&HFF&)}The Five Elders
Dialogue: 2,0:24:20.11,0:24:24.19,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,722)\fad(435,435)\blur0.6\bord0\fscx175\fscy175\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\4a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&}The Five Elders
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.20,0:24:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been suffering through this great\Npirate era for more than a decade now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.68,0:24:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a vile sickness that grows\Nworse with every passing day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.12,0:24:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time for idle discussion is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.18,0:24:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must do more than prevent\Nthis weapon's construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.84,0:24:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must build it ourselves and use\Nit as a mighty instrument of justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.34,0:24:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With it,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.25,0:24:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can eliminate this pirate scourge and\Nbring law and order back to our land!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.16,0:24:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is indeed a troubling error.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.78,0:24:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.30,0:24:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your primary objective will be to\Nlocate and then obtain these blueprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.48,0:24:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That will be all at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.18,0:24:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We trust that you can complete\Nthis mission, Spandam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.98,0:24:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! Without fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.96,0:25:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been working on this case for far\Ntoo long to see it all go up in smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.20,0:25:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right within my grasp now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.68,0:25:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.60,0:25:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.28,0:25:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the judge decides to acquit him,\Nthat'll mean a real headache for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.76,0:25:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spot him, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.86,0:25:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The charge will stick, and\Nthat bastard will hang.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.08,0:25:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men, I'll need five more agents, stat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.38,0:25:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.32,0:25:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg, Franky. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.42,0:25:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boys, come here. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.86,0:25:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time I let you\Nin on something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.18,0:26:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would anyone even dream\Nof something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.10,0:26:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.58,0:26:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can this thing actually be built?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.42,0:26:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the blueprints for\Na nightmare, a real monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.76,0:26:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government has\Nlearned of their existence
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.98,0:26:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and has started sniffing around for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.28,0:26:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous for\Nme to keep them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.16,0:26:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrifying, but I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.82,0:26:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.64,0:26:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.55,0:26:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's see if we can\Nbuild this thing! You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.78,0:26:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you ever think before you speak,\Nthis thing can never be built?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.94,0:26:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you realize how much\Ndestruction it could cause?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.30,0:26:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the world would be done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.26,0:26:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides trying to build the damn thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.26,0:26:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can do whatever the hell\Nyou want with it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.40,0:26:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even toss it if you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.06,0:26:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.62,0:26:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I got your attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.32,0:26:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here's another storm a-brewin'.

